OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain and
OL,6,Fshowers moving to the east this
OL,7,Fevening, leaving clear spells and
OL,8,Fwintry showers, these mostly in
OL,9,Fnorthern Scotland. Temperatures
OL,10,Ffalling way, below freezing in the
OL,11,Fnorth with a widespread rural frost
OL,12,Fand icy stretches.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FA cold start with showers in
OL,15,Fthe north and east easing leaving
OL,16,Fsunny spells. Sunshine turning hazy
OL,17,Finto the afternoon with rain and
OL,18,Fstronger winds moving into the
OL,19,Fsouthwest later.
